WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:16.650
The resulting database tracks 1.2 billion dollars in political contributions, decodes 350,000 lobbying contacts, and maintains 1,105 formal data entries connecting specific policymakers to legislative outcomes.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:22.675
The methodology relies entirely on the quantitative structure of the government's own publishing.
